  "descriptionHtml": "<div>Silver-tone stainless steel case and bracelet. Fixed blue ion-plated stainless steel showing tachymeter markings bezel. Blue dial with luminous silver-tone hands and index hour markers. Arabic numeral appears at the 12 o'clock position. Minute markers around the outer rim. Dial Type: Analog. Luminescent hands and markers. Date display between the 4 and 5 o'clock positions. Chronograph - three sub-dials displaying:  60 second, 30 minute and 12-24 hour. Seiko Caliber 8T63 quartz movement. Scratch resistant Hardlex crystal. Pull / push crown. Solid case back. Round case shape, case size: 43.9 mm, case thickness: 12 mm. Band width: 20 mm. Fold over clasp. Water resistant at 100 meters / 330 feet. Functions: chronograph, tachymeter, date, hour, minute, second. Essentials Series. Sport watch style. Watch label: Japan Movt. Seiko Essentials Chronograph Quartz Blue Dial Men's Watch Ssb345.</div>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600;\">Technical Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n    <tbody>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Brand</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Seiko</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Series</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Essentials</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Model</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">SSB345</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Gender</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Men's</td></tr>\n   